- **Learnings for future iterations:**
  - The existing `users.id` column is `uuid`, so new stamp references need
    `uuid` foreign keys instead of the older text sketch in the design doc.
  - This repo already has text-based migration tests in Vitest; focused
    schema stories can follow that pattern without spinning up Postgres.
  - Rollback SQL is not present in older migrations, but stamp accounting
    uses a sibling `down.sql` to satisfy reversibility.
  - Typechecking the whole repo requires Vitest global types; existing tests
    use global `expect`.
